window.products.push({"id":720040,"name":"Cadima Delicates Mesh Laundry Bags Set of 5 (Small,Medium,L,XL,Bra Bag),Wash Bags for Delicates Lingeries Hosiery Sweater Bras Underwear Socks,Travel ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61C9xabCdyL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Why buy laundry wash bags? Your delicates get damaged from machine washing?Fed up with the clothes tangling during wash?Afraid of putting your delicates into the washing machine?Socks get missing in the washer?Tired from hand washing?Looking for better washing solutions? Now try our Cadima wash bags and the days of such washing problems are over! Our wash bags set is a very simple but best solution for machine washing problems such as clothing tangles, snags, pilling, deformation, abrasion and buttons being tore off. They not only well organize and sort your laundry, but also guarantee a thorough cleaning and rinse, moreover, these wash bags keep your delicates and luxury clothes always in a good condition. And somehow, the wash bags protect as well your washing machine by reducing the chances that small articles (coins, keys, etc.) accidentally left in some pockets of your laundry slip into the machine and cause its failure. What makes the wash bags such a good wash assistance? 1. The breathable fine mesh fabric allows water flow in for a thorough cleaning and rinse, at the same time keeps your delicates separated from each other to avoid any damages from washing and drying;2. Five different sizes suit for different type of clothes: X-Large for down jacket, bed cover; Large for coat, jacket, bedsheets; Medium for sweater, jeans; Small for blouse, T-shirts, socks; Bra bag especially for bras and underwear. They make your laundry well organized!3. The durable polyester fiber material supports years of usage.4. The elastic pocket design keeps the zipper tightly closed to prevent accidental bag openings that causes item missing during wash. Note: 1. Don't overload the bag (Less than 2/3 capacity of the bag is suggested.).2. Only for those that can be machine washed clothes. Don't use them for those that need hand wash or dry wash.3. Away from sharp objects.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61C9xabCdyL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"CADIMA","source_asin":"B01K1XNZKM","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-720040","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01K1XNZKM","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01K1XNZKM","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
