window.products.push({"id":720071,"name":"Home Accent Furnishings Transitional Farmhouse Framed 6-Drawer Dresser with Cup Handles - Caramel","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71pHBpX6eEL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Add storage space into your home for your clothing and extra throws or pillows with this 6 drawer dresser. In a stylish, Mid-century modern design featuring angled legs and cutout handles of solid pine wood in a stained finish. The intriguing design integrates a transitional aesthetic to complement your home décor. With six storage deep drawers to keep your clothing organized in your bedroom or for blankets and extra bedding in your guest room. Mid-century modern dresser Made of solid pine wood in a stained finish Wood responsibly sourced from renewable forests Features cutout handles that add to the design 6 drawers on wood runners Block angled legs Wall anchor and hardware for anti-tip safety Assembly is required Returns: We want you to be happy with your purchase and offer a 30-day return policy on most orders. Returns will be accepted within 30 days of delivery, so long as they are in their original packaging. Assembled products and final sales items cannot be returned. We provide a return address in the US so if the item is returned for reasons falling under \"buyer’s remorse”, outbound shipping, which may have been free originally, will be deducted. If your item is damaged or defective in any way, please reach out to our team prior to creating a return. We may be able to replace your item or ship parts to ensure your satisfaction. Please refer to Amazon’s Seller Returns Policy section for additional help. Warranty We offer a 30-day warranty against manufacturer defects, damaged and/or missing parts. If there are any issues with your product, please notify us within 30 days of purchase to ensure any such claim can be approved. A claim submitted outside 30 days is subject to rejection.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71pHBpX6eEL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Home Accent Furnishings","source_asin":"B08B43BZRL","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-720071","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08B43BZRL","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08B43BZRL","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":720072,"name":"Epicurean Non-Slip Series Cutting Board, 11.5-Inch by 9-Inch, Nutmeg/Red","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61116ybO3dL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","description":"This durable, dishwasher safe board by Epicurean is Made in USA, specifically on the North Shore of Lake Superior in Duluth, MN.  It is an excellent choice for both the casual cook and the seasoned gourmet who values the environment and wants a dependable cutting board that is durable and cleans up easily. Every Non-Slip Cutting Board is made with naturally renewable or recycled materials in an environmentally responsible way, made from a wood fiber composite with silicone corners that grip the surface of your countertop.  Wood Fiber Composite is sheets of resin-saturated fiber are compressed and baked to a solid sheet.  The final product is exceptionally strong, yet maintains the warm, natural look and feel of wood. It is lightweight, nonporous, knife friendly and dishwasher safe.  It won’t crack, split, or stain – making it the perfect material for cutting and serving.  It also is classified as green.  The wood fiber raw material comes from Forest Stewardship Council (FSC) certified sources and/or recycled paper.  This durable material itself has been around for more than 65 years and is widely used for commercial, industrial and marine purposes, as well as skate park surfaces.  It certainly can take anything dished out in the heart of the kitchen. The durable boards have a ¼” profile so they are lightweight and easy to store.  The built in hole makes it easy to grab and use.  Epicurean is a way of life - a reflection of our personal values and those of our customers. Our products are well-designed, practical, casual tools that feel at home in any kitchen where friends and family gather to share company and enjoy good food. This natural colored non-slip board with slate silicone corners measures 11.5 x 9 inches, can be used on both sides and is dishwasher safe.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61116ybO3dL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Epicurean","source_asin":"B00FJDFVQ6","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-720072","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00FJDFVQ6","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00FJDFVQ6","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":720073,"name":"HydroBlu Jerry Can Activated Carbon Replacement","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":9.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31OIKoZed1L._AC_.jpg","description":"Whether your water source is a clear mountain spring or a silt filled lake, it has never been more important to remove harmful metals, chemicals, and contaminants from environmental changes along with human modernization. The use of Activated Carbon has been found to be one of the best natural compounds for filtering out those unwanted elements while also improving taste and color clarity. The Activated Carbon Filter, along with the Pressurized Jerry Can is the perfect filter to protect your family.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31OIKoZed1L._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"HydroBlu","source_asin":"B06XYGQK5F","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-720073","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B06XYGQK5F","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B06XYGQK5F","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
