window.products.push({"id":720116,"name":"IM Corona Old Boy Lighter - Chrome Engine-Turned","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":150.4,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81aHwm0S7dL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Imagine yourself enjoying a smoke in the streets of Paris under the moonlight. That is what it is like to light up with a Corona Old Boy Pipe Lighter. Classic and attractive, this torch is ideal for the modern gentleman who longs for the finest accessories. Whether you are enjoying a traditional pipe or just a smooth cigar, the 90 degrees angled flame is sure to get the job done--in style.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81aHwm0S7dL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"IM Corona","source_asin":"B00YFPGVLS","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-720116","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00YFPGVLS","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00YFPGVLS","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":720117,"name":"Arts Of India Pure Copper Water Bottle, Drink ware Set, Capacity 1000 ML, Set of 2 (PLAIN 2)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":33.49,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61er81tMHbL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"HEALTHY LIFESTYLE:- At this time when the world is riddled with pollution, our countrymen are using high potency tablets even for minor problems which is spreading poision in their bodies. Our saints and even doctors have found a very easy method to deal with such disorders. The best remedy to overcome these problems is to store water in a copper utensil overnight and drink four glasses every morning. After this you can wash your mouth and brush your teeth. It is also advisable not to take tea for at least 45 minutes. Patients who can not drink four glasses of water at a time, can start with smaller quantity and increase the quantity gradually. There is no diseases in the world which can not be cured by this method. It is useful to drink water before sunrise for all including healthy persons. We request everybody to propogate this morning water use to every one whosoever is suffering from any disease. Care Tips a) Clean your copperware by hand and avoid dishwasher as the detergent can cause oxidation leading to permanent damage. b) Use a solution of equal quantities vinegar or lemon juice and salt diluted with some water at such times but don't use it regularly. c) Avoid scratchy cleaners like steel wool. d) A simple, soft cleaning liquid on soap base, hot water and a soft washing cloth is best for daily use. e) Use Copper Shining Powder for cleaning the copper utensils. Completely safe and gentle on hands. f) Copper Utensils Tarnish from time to time. This is Normal for an Authentic Copper utensils. ; Many Customers Love the Vintage/Antique Tarnished Look Instructions: Copper utensils needs to be cleaned at regular interval for removing the dark marks. Dark marks are formed due to oxidization process. It is the basic nature of Pure Copper that it oxidizes when it comes in the contact of air and water","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61er81tMHbL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Arts Of India","source_asin":"B09Y61JHCH","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-720117","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09Y61JHCH","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09Y61JHCH","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
