window.products.push({"id":720389,"name":"Artificial Tree in Gray Marble Effect Planter, Fake Ficus Silk Tree for Indoor and Outdoor Home Decoration - 66\" Overall Tall (Plant Pot Plus Tree)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81R2dKehqdL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Perfect for all Seasons At times, it can be hard to venture outside and enjoy nature. With Signwin's Ficus Tree, you can create your own personal organic environment! Perfect for home and office, our artificial plants have a natural botanical allure that can alter the atmosphere of any space. Enjoy nature year-round with Signwin's Ficus Tree! Easy Maintenance Real plants can be a hassle. Constant upkeep to ensure a plant remains healthy can be a waste of energy and resources. With Signwin's Ficus Tree, no watering is necessary. With stems and branches made from polyester and leaves made from silk, our Ficus Tree is easy to clean! Simply wipe in soft cloth whenever necessary. Simple Assembly Our plants come in two pieces. One piece includes the artificial plant, which is attached to the moss base. The second piece is the plastic planter. Simply insert the plant and moss base into the plastic planter for quick assemblage. Attention to Detail We believe in crafting durable decor that stands the test of time. Our in-house design team routinely checks the details of or plants and planters to ensure perfect product quality. We strive to bring customers the most unique and durable synthetic plants. Your Ficus Tree and accompanying planter will always be perfectly crafted, matching our exacting standards.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81R2dKehqdL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"SIGNWIN","source_asin":"B08NSYYSGL","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-720389","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08NSYYSGL","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08NSYYSGL","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":720390,"name":"Slitree Apple Peeler Slicer Corer 3 in 1 Hand-Cranking Peeler with Suction Base for Kitchen","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/6174I+P2z+L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"KITCHEN ARTIFACT - peel, slice and core your apples, potatoes in one motion! OPERATE STEPS 1. Suck the apple peeler on the kitchen countertop or other smooth surface and make sure it sucked stably. 2. Loosen the screw guide on the handle end of the machine and pull the handle back completely. 3. Place the stems of apple or potato etc. on the three-prong, spiral mandrel and press them to approximately 1/8 inch. 4. Spin the handle continuously to peel, slice, core the apple simultaneously. 5. Take off the fruit and enjoy it! PEEL, SLICE AND CORE, MULTIFUNCTIONAL 3 IN 1 APPLE PEELER PEELING: Adjust the peeling blade to remove as little or as much peel as you choose, and get the corer slicer blade away from the apple, turn the handle to peel your apple, an apple without peel appear. CORING + SLICING: Get down the peeler blade, align the round knife of corer with the apple core, press the base with your left hand and turn the handle with your right hand, spiral apple ring with peel appear. CORING + SLICING + PEELING: Adjust the peeler blade to right point and align the round knife of corer with the apple core, press the base with your left hand and turn the handle with your right hand, a spiral apple ring made in 5 seconds. WHAT CAN YOU DO WITH APPLE SLICES? APPLE CINNAMON CIRCLESCut your peeled, sliced & cored apples just once to create circles. You can use them to make perfect apple cinnamon rings. APPLE PIESGive your apples 2 cuts if you want to create semicircles. These will work great if you want to bake a perfect apple pie. DRIED APPLE SLICESSlice your apples in smaller chunks if you would like to make dried apple slices. It can be used to peel/core/slice fruits and vegetables, dehydrated apples, apple cobbler, or to make fruit pies, salad, canned products and every exotic dish you can think of! START YOUR MAGICAL KITCHEN JOURNEY NOW!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/6174I+P2z+L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Slitree","source_asin":"B08VSGVY61","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-720390","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08VSGVY61","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08VSGVY61","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
