window.products.push({"id":720408,"name":"Big Eyes - Mexican Sugar Skull Mold","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51n0E9hZaGL._AC_.jpg","description":"This 2-piece mold makes 1 extra large sugar skull. This is the largest, most realistic Mexican sugar skull mold we have. It's whimsical with the big eye recesses to decorate and it's a big skull with lots of room to decorate. The reason this mold is so special and has been long requested is because the back of the head is exactly the same size as the front. This means the skull sits up straight and does not recline, which is preferable to some people. For chocolate makers who wanted a big skull to make hollow chocolate sugar skulls, this is perfect. They would still need to clamp the 2 plastic molds together, but it doesn't have a smaller back of the head as the Original Large has. This skull is fun to make and in size, falls between the Original Large & Oaxacan XL mold. It's very important to use our strong CK Products meringue powder and scoop to 1/4\" - 1/3\" walls before assembly.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51n0E9hZaGL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Generic","source_asin":"B0BFRX5YNV","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-720408","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BFRX5YNV","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BFRX5YNV","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
