window.products.push({"id":720448,"name":"JARAGAR Sprouting Jar Kit, 2Pcs Mason Jars with 304 Stainless Steel Sprout Lids, Strainer, Stands and Drip Tray, Seed Growing Set for Broccoli Alfalfa","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":16.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61STqYrnLLL._AC_.jpg","description":"Package Included: 2 X 1000ml Mason jars 2 X sprouting lids 2 X stainless steel stand 1 X drip tray (Seeds not included) Features: COMPLETE SPROUTING SET - Everything you need to grow your own delicious sprouts and microgreens at home, You can add delicious and nutritious fresh ingredients to your diet. Enjoy fresh sprouts in salads, sandwiches, stir-fry, soups, and more.  SAFE & DURABLE MATERIAL -Stainless steel stand and mesh lids are BPA free material, safer than plastic lids as they are durable and free of toxic materials. EASY TO USE - The practical design allows for easy drainage and well airflow. Soak seeds for 8-10 hours, then drain completely. Rinse the sprouts twice a day and set them on stands to drain the excess water. You will get fresh sprouts in 3-5 days. EAST TO CLEAR - Jars are made from thick flint glass and in wide mouth for easy access to sprouts. The lids, stand, jars, tray are dishwasher safe. Drip tray stores drain-out water to avoid making a mess on your counter-top. GREAT GIFT IDEA FOR EVERY HOME - It is a practical and attractive decor for kitchen and home. It can also give you and your children the joy of harvest. How to Use ???STEP 1 - Choose your highly quality seeds, nuts or beans and give them a good soak for 8-10 hours (The time depends on the seed variety)STEP 2- Drain the sprouts and set the stainless steel screen sprouting lid in placeSTEP 3- The stands will hold the jar in the perfect position to thoroughly drain the sprouts while encouraging ventilationSTEP 4- Rinse the sprouts twice a day for 3-5 daysSTEP 5- After this minimal effort, your harvest will be ready to eat!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61STqYrnLLL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"JARAGAR","source_asin":"B0BHT4PK84","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-720448","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BHT4PK84","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BHT4PK84","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
