window.products.push({"id":720505,"name":"Queen Two Pack: Luxury Real Down & Feather pillow, 100% Pure Cotton by Duck and Goose co","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61aig388vCL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"There's nothing quite like waking up after a fantastic sleep. Feeling refreshed and energized, it's the ideal way to start your day and enjoy life to the full. All-natural properties crafted with care Specially crafted with 100% crushed feather (95% feather, 5% down) this feather pillow, unlike polyester, stays cool against the skin and maintains its shape, providing exceptional comfort and a supremely sumptuous feel. Hypo-allergenic with effective spinal support The Duck & Goose Company feather pillow is hypo-allergenic and features medium-to-firm density which is especially comfortable for side sleepers as the shape fills the space between your head and shoulder supporting the proper alignment of the spine. Perfect blend of premium design with stylish aesthetic Our pillows don't just feel incredible – our premium quality pillow covers look exquisite too. Our stylish pillow cover is made from 100% cotton with a 233 thread-count and features double-hemmed stitching for the ultimate in luxury, durability and protection. Quick and easy care instructions For your convenience, our pillows can be machine washed and dried. Suggestion for optimal use Before you enjoy your new feather pillow, please place it in the dryer for 20 minutes. This works to restore it to its original fluffy condition. This will also help to remove the natural feather odor. We only use natural materials to create our feather pillow which means that it may flatten during use. Simply place it in the dryer on a low heat for 20 minutes to fluff up the feathers. Best quality and service for your peace of mind The Duck and Goose Company offer a two-year warranty on our products and if for any reason you are not satisfied with your purchase, please contact us and we will do our very best to assist you.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61aig388vCL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Duck Duck Goose","source_asin":"B01BXWCIZS","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-720505","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01BXWCIZS","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01BXWCIZS","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
