window.products.push({"id":720517,"name":"Cen-Tec Systems 35174 Sidewinder 15 Inch Hard Floor Vacuum Brush with 1.5-Inch Neck, 15\", Black","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":41.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51xOG8k3zNL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","description":"This Sidewinder 15\" hard surface brush with 100% natural fill and 1. 5\" neck is used with a wand and is a great combination with backpack vacuums for office buildings, institutions, hospitals, etc. By using this product cleaning efficiency is increased exponentially as well as making it less physically taxing. The tools unique design uses a side to side sweeping motion instead of hunched over pushing and pulling a heavy commercial vacuum causing a lot of strain on their back. It is used with a straight wand rather than the traditional \"S\" or \"J\" wand system used with traditional tools. These tools have found great favor with contract cleaners for their ability to increase productivity and detail tight places. The Sidewinder tool is wide one way to cover more surface area when cleaning open areas and narrow the other direction to make it possible to clean those tight spaces without having to pull out a hose and attachment and bending over with your traditional vacuum, which makes it possible to easily navigating around and under furniture. The flexible neck permits the tool to flex 90 Degree to the wand. This permits the tool to vacuum across the tool width, vacuum end on, or to vacuum vertical surfaces with equal effectiveness. The Sidewinder tools are perfect low cost solution for your commercial cleaning needs.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51xOG8k3zNL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Cen-Tec Systems","source_asin":"B08BXSZWKR","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-720517","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08BXSZWKR","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08BXSZWKR","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":720518,"name":"Toothpick Holder Dispenser Automatic+Toothpicks Pak - Designed in US - Small &Spacious(Blue)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/716h1iGfVeL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"One click toothpick holder dispenser Material: Plastic color: Different colors (blue, green, pink) the hat is transparent what completes the design well The tray can accommodate up to 200 toothpicks How to use: Fill the device with toothpicks,preferably peaky side down Close the cap-->Click on the button and dispense the toothpick. ONE CLICK- 1 TOOTHPICK Be careful with your children, as toothpicks may be more dangerous than they seem. Enjoy the 21st century comfort with us! Don't forget to smile!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/716h1iGfVeL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"HeGe Zheng","source_asin":"B0813TH9B6","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-720518","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0813TH9B6","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0813TH9B6","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
