window.products.push({"id":720655,"name":"Core Bamboo 3-Piece Rome Utensil Set","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81T-YGwBdHL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"The perfect marriage of materials to make cooking easier; silicone and bamboo utensils incorporate the best features of both materials to make the ultimate cooking utensils. Core Bamboo's ''Rome'' Bamboo and Silicone 3-piece utensil set features 3 various sized spatula heads made of premium silicone and our strong, durable bamboo for the handle. Silicone has a high-heat resistance making for the perfect tool to scrape out pans without scratching, while the flexible head gets every last drop of food. The bamboo handle provides incredible strength for those tough jobs where you need to apply effort. The variety of sizes allows you to reach deep into the smallest condiment jar, or scrape out the largest kitchen bowl with the same amount of ease. Core Bamboo is committed to creating superior products, while taking care of the people who create them, and the environment that provides the resources. Bamboo is one of the most remarkable resources available, regenerating itself every 4 years. This fact, along with understanding bamboo is stronger than maple and lighter than oak, and has naturally antiseptic properties, makes bamboo the perfect choice for wood products for the home. All bamboo used by Core Bamboo is 100-Percent organically grown, with vibrant colors achieved using food-safe, water-based adhesives and natural oils. Each product meets FDA and European Food Safety guidelines. Exceptional products and a belief in ethical and social responsibility; it is no wonder Core Home continues to win honors and awards by its peers, while customers order Core products again and again.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81T-YGwBdHL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Core Bamboo","source_asin":"B0083V90U4","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-720655","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0083V90U4","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0083V90U4","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
