window.products.push({"id":720846,"name":"Dollhouse Bedding, 4 Piece Set with Comforter & Pillows, Blanket, Realistic Bedroom Accessories for 6 inch Dolls, 1/12 Scale, Blue Yellow","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":14.49,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91n5tAVhM2L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Full Bedding Set: 4 piece set that includes a comforter / blanket, and three (3) throw pillows for your dollhouse bedroom or nursery; making it the perfect choice for adding a classy and elegant touch to your miniature doll house bed décor. Made With Care: Our 1 inch scale dollhouse accessories are handmade with close attention to even the smallest details using high quality, soft fabrics and detailed stitching. Each piece is perfect for every day play. They are perfect for 1/24 scale to 1/12 scale dolls and beds (i.e. 3 inch dolls to 6 inch dolls). Elegant Bedding & Linen: The mini blue comforter is finished on both sides. The blue side has a beautiful white lace stitched over it. The back side of the comforter is white fabric. This set also includes 3 (three) pillows, two yellow and one blue. The blue pillow has lace over the middle of it. All three pillow covers can be removed. Dimensions: The comforter is 7\" x 6 1/2\". Each pillow is 1 3/4\" x 1 1/2\". Please refer to the photos for more information regarding dimensions. This set can fit queen and twin beds. All pieces are made in the 1:12 scale, and are washable. Suitable for any Occasion: This dollhouse bedding set makes a great toy for boys and girls; a gift for any occasion. It is well suited for a variety of doll brands, action figures, and art & craft projects. Inusitus brand of dollhouse furniture and decorations include realistic living room, kitchen and bathroom miniatures, including sofas and couches, area rugs, lights, side tables and more.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91n5tAVhM2L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Inusitus","source_asin":"B08YNK47HQ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-720846","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08YNK47HQ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08YNK47HQ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":720847,"name":"Motor Scooter (Vespa) Rotary Candleholder","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71NY2+uBhhL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"When the included tea light candle is lit in the base of the rotary candle holder, the heat of the candle will make the motor scooter and the carousel spin, and shaped reflections move around the ceiling. Comes nicely presented in a box ideal as a gift. Remarkably sophisticated with just a touch of whimsy, this motor scooter candle holder is a wonderful way to bring smiles with a unique display of entertainment in motion! Each of our stunning rotary candle holders is crafted from durable metal with a beautiful silver finish. Just position the flickering tea light candle (included), and within moments the heat from the flame will set the art in motion. You can add your own scented tea light and indulge in your favorite aroma. These Änglaspel are designed in and imported from Sweden. They are contemporary versions of the traditional candle chimes. Because these were designed to actually rotate and cast beautiful shadows, the metal is thin, and the item light-weight. Some of the competing rotary candle holders you will see have less detail (especially in shadow), and 4 clappers rather than our 6. When you see the Pluto Produkter AB as the manufacturer and PlutoGifts as the merchant, you can be confident of high quality and wonderful attention to detail. In order to see the hundred different choices from Pluto Produkter AB just type \"rotary candleholder\" in the search box above. For those of us who grew up with them, rotary candle holders are a seasonal blend of light and motion. They belong to a purely domestic and old-fashioned type of joy, one that emphasizes a dark room over a brightly lit one (to appreciate the dancing interplay of light and shadow); and calm over activity (so that stray air currents shouldn’t disrupt the workings). Darkness, stillness, silence: all inescapable aspects of the northern winter, and it is therefore not surprising that candleholders are such an enduring tradition.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71NY2+uBhhL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Pluto Produkter","source_asin":"B07681ZKNN","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-720847","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07681ZKNN","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07681ZKNN","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
