window.products.push({"id":720900,"name":"Maverton Whiskey decanter set with 6 glasses for man - Personalized liquor dispenser for him - Whisky carafe for Birthday - 7 piece set for whiskey lo","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":66.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/711IAWEMHiL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"🎁UNIQUE WHISKEY SET Our set includes a 24.6 oz decanter with a hermetic closure and 10.5 oz glasses. It is ideal to store and sip a glass of whiskey, scotch, bourbon, rum or cognac. An elegant decanter with glasses to serve your favorite alcohol in style. Perfect for everyday use and special occasions. Our set is made from best quality glass with an elegant, remarkable and modern look. Weighted design for stability. 🎈 FOR MEN Specially designed for whisky/scotch lovers. The unique personalized set will make an original gift on various occasions. Working well as an ideal gift choice for your father, husband, granddad, uncle, boyfriend, boss and all whiskey enthusiasts. Celebrate his special day (birthday, anniversary, graduation, Father’s Day) the right way or let him enjoy the nice whiskey time after a long, tough day. 🔬PERSONAL ENGRAVING To make your choice one-of-a kind gift idea, we laser engrave the glass pieces to suit your needs.You can add a special message to be engraved in a lovely script font to create a beautiful bespoke gift, ideal for a birthday, wedding or anniversary! To customize your item, click, ‘’customize now’’ on the right side of the page where you can choose from different personalized quotes, wishes and personalization templates. 💎 STYLISH A decanter set has a classic, discreet and sophisticated style to perfectly complement any house decor. The elegant and beautifully crafted carafe will be a perfect addition to any fancy gathering. Personalization makes the set especially meaningful to fit any occasion and celebrate with style. Let your dearest ones enjoy the whiskey with our nicely engraved glass set, and upgrade their home bar to the next level. 👍 PRACTICAL The whiskey set is the ultimate liquor- lover accessory. It features a high quality glass decanter and 6 etched glasses. The carafe can store the liquor well, perfectly maintaining the aroma and flavor of the beverage and the glass ensures maximum clarity and brilliance. Stylish and classic design will compliment any home decor.This whiskey decanter set is crafted from high quality glass that will make a style statement in your home, office or as a gift.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/711IAWEMHiL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Maverton","source_asin":"B09RPX7Q63","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-720900","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09RPX7Q63","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09RPX7Q63","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
